SUMMARY:Maleny Community Centre 2026 Annual General Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The AGM is an opportunity to reflect on the past year\, celebra
 te our achievements\, and look ahead to the future of the Centre. We are d
 elighted to welcome Dave Southern as our guest speaker. Dave led the team 
 that designed and hand-carved the magnificent timber entrance doors to the
  Main Hall—one of the Centre’s most recognisable and treasured feature
 s. He will share insights into his artistic journey\, his work as a woodca
 rver\, and the inspiration behind his craft. Dave will also assist in a sp
 ecial unveiling. We hope you can join us for what promises to be an enjoya
 ble and inspiring morning as we celebrate our Centre\, its history\, and t
 he people who have contributed to its success. Date: Wednesday 30th Septem
 ber 2026 Time: 10.30am Venue: Verandah Room\, Maleny Community Centre
LOCATION:Maleny Community Centre Verandah Room
URL:https://malenycc.org/event/maleny-community-centre-2026-annual-general-
 meeting/
